    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why i bother calling them anymore. i spent 6 hours on hold today just to be told my file doesn't exist. like i'm actually standing here, i have a life, but according to the system i just... don't. it's like im being erased and there's nothing anyone can do to stop it. it just feels like the world is designed to just grind people like me into nothing.",
