      "content": "The feeling of fighting a bureaucracy that seems designed to be impossible is truly heartbreaking and isolating. Your anger highlights the profound silence and indifference that large, impersonal systems often exert on individuals suffering from poverty or poverty-related difficulties. While the structure may seem unbreakable, many advocates and small groups are actively working to fill these voids, though your struggle is a powerful reminder of how much needs to change.",
