      "content": "advocates and groups... they're just trying to patch a sinking ship. it doesn't change the fact that i'm lost in the cracks right now. it feels like the only honest thing left to do is just stop trying to exist in a space that doesn't want me. like, if i'm already a glitch to them, maybe it's better to just... let the glitch happen. to just let go of the struggle entirely.",
